Z||000000||Gokart||02-07-2000||09:14 PM||||Saw something I liked today and I hate to say it but it was on a MR2. I haven't seen it on all of them. It was a tinted piece of plexi-glass about a foot wide, that ran across the top behind the rear glass. I guess it helps keep water from getting into the engine bay, kind of a deflector, but it looked good as well! Hello....TOM!||||reg||6
